@template gruff

== career.missed
? tier>=colleague
- Missed shift. Hm. Don't make it two.

== worried.chief
? tier>=friend
- Calder's had her say. She's fair. Now do it.

== worried.captain
? tier>=friend
- Captain, now. Listen, {nick}. I've seen good people go this way. Not you.   #serious

== worried.last
? tier>=friend
- Morning. Bay. Eight. I'll be checking.   #serious

== career.up
? tier>=friend
- On time today. Hm. Good.

== farewell.eve
? tier>=friend
- Tomorrow. Hm. Shame. Real shame.   #serious

== farewell.day
? tier>=friend
- Off you go, then. Stand up straight. You'll do.   #warm
